WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,160
This time it's completely blown up.

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,920
It’s not fair for a bunch of people to speculate

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:09,430
Why should you let them die? There are still a few who want you to come forward.

4
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:12,930
Just uphold justice for everyone

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,980
Then go and seek justice?

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,930
They still expect you to set the rules

7
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:19,850
Allotted to the governor's team

8
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:21,450
Keren just refuses to accept it

9
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:27,610
Why should I be the same as you? Do you deserve it? Take a step back and divide it equally.

10
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:31,650
When they are almost done eating, all the people who robbed, deceived and made private deals will appear.

11
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,930
I can't stand this kind of stall

12
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,810
If this group of people has potential

13
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:38,530
I don't mind helping out

14
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:51,880
But I bet they will just fight and go their separate ways in the end. I understand. Let’s go out again today.

15
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:56,340
We'll go somewhere early tomorrow morning to Minghu. Don't you want to take a shower?

16
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,860
On the way, I searched the small supermarket next door to get some food.
